# Room 3 — wallpaper (distinctive DNA)

**Built (first version):** `match_spatial` downweights DNA dimensions that look the same across almost every saved layout (low spread = wallpaper) and upweights high-spread / distinctive traits. Size still also cuts when two strategies are almost equally close. **Same-TF only** — a 15m watch line never nearest-neighbors a 1m vault recipe.

**Not done:** True corpus IDF from a large pattern library; operator-facing wallpaper diagnostics.

**Related:** Room 3 maps use strategy recipes (lookback + sensors); Job 1 Yahoo screener is parked (`BUILTIN_SCREENER_ENABLED = False`).
